    "切換視窗後繼續": "After switching windows",
    "只有本身允許在背景接收並處理按鍵訊息的程式，才會在你操作其他視窗時繼續回應。AutoKey 不會把焦點搶回來，也不需因切回視窗反覆重新啟動。": "Only apps designed to receive and process key messages in the background will keep responding while you use another window. AutoKey will not take focus, and switching back does not require you to restart it.",
    "「執行中」代表正在傳送指令，不代表目標程式已採納。建議先以簡單按鍵確認反應，再設定群組。": "\"Running\" means commands are being sent, not that the app has accepted them. Test its response with a simple key before setting up groups.",
