    "切換到其他視窗，還能繼續嗎？": "Will it keep running if I switch windows?",
    "可以，前提是目標程式接受背景按鍵訊息。AutoKey 不會切換你的操作焦點；切回目標視窗也不需要反覆按快捷鍵重新啟動。鎖定、休眠或目標關閉時的停止規則，請依桌面程式說明操作。": "Yes, provided the target app accepts key messages in the background. AutoKey will not change your focus, and switching back does not require another hotkey press to restart it. Refer to the desktop app instructions for how execution stops when the computer locks, sleeps, or the target app closes.",
    "為什麼顯示執行中，目標卻沒有反應？": "Why does it say running when the app is not responding?",
    "傳送訊息不代表目標已採納。程式的輸入方式、背景接收設計或權限都可能影響結果。請先用簡單按鍵實際測試；保持前景或提高權限，也無法保證所有程式都相容。": "Sending a message does not mean the target app has accepted it. Its input method, background input handling, and permissions can all affect the result. Test with a simple key first. Keeping the window active or using elevated permissions does not guarantee compatibility.",
    "可以設定一組複雜連招嗎？": "Can I set up a complex combo?",
    "目前支援把連點與長壓按鍵整理成群組，群組內按鍵同時起算。尚未支援依序輸出的指令序列與精確連招，也不保證多鍵組合效果。格鬥情境是靜態拆解示意，並非現有連招功能。": "You can currently group repeated presses and holds, with all keys in a group starting their timers together. Sequential commands and precisely timed combos are not supported, and combinations of multiple keys are not guaranteed to work. The fighting game scenario is a static input breakdown, not an existing combo feature.",
    "桌面程式支援哪些介面語言？": "Which languages does the desktop app support?",
    "如何取得程式與 Steam 版本？": "Where can I get the app or the Steam version?",
