    "設定會自動保存、跨電腦同步嗎？": "Are settings saved automatically and synced between computers?",
    "桌面程式會在本機保存按鍵群組與語言偏好。Steam Cloud 同步流程正在準備，尚待 Steam 後台啟用與雙機驗收；目前不宣稱已提供跨電腦雲端同步。": "The desktop app saves key groups and language preferences locally. Steam Cloud sync is being prepared and still needs to be enabled in Steamworks and verified on two computers. Cloud sync between computers is not yet available as a confirmed feature.",
